<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz March unemployment unchanged at 4.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz March unemployment unchanged at 4.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Kyrgyzstan totalled 71,000, or 4.0 percent of the workforce, at the end of March, from 72,000 in February, the National Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ UNEMPLOYMENT	   Mar 97     Feb 97     Mar 96</p>
<p> number unemployed		  71,000     72,000     71,700</p>
<p> percentage of workforce	   4.0	  4.0	  4.1</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
